{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-everun-ert-1500-rough-terrain-telehandler-2511-0158","content_id":"f04f8e1f-3efd-453a-a248-23d0bda1eaaa","description":"Product Safety Report for Everun ERT 1500 Rough Terrain Telehandler presenting a serious risk of injuries. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"d5537118-8dff-48b4-8f19-ba5e9978b5f5","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-12-18T10:08:38+00:00","id":"d5537118-8dff-48b4-8f19-ba5e9978b5f5","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-12-18T10:08:38+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6943d2a636f089d38be1f2b6/2511-0158-product-safety-report-everun-1500-rough-terrain-telehandler.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Everun ERT 1500 Rough Terrain Telehandler</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of injuries as a result of the absence of a coherent conformity assessment and quality control regime.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The sale or supply of machines with serial numbers 1BT01K2900 and 1BT01K2890 has been prohibited in Great Britain.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Machinery – Compact Rough Terrain Telehandler</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>ERT 1500</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Type</td>\n      <td>All machines missing essential safety features (see below). Accompanying Declaration of Conformity may refer to the machine as a wheel loader.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Compact, rough terrain variable reach truck (telehandler) supplied with fork and bucket attachments.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_d5537118-8dff-48b4-8f19-ba5e9978b5f5\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6943d2a636f089d38be1f2b6/2511-0158-product-safety-report-everun-1500-rough-terrain-telehandler.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>Some machines of this model, including serial numbers 1BT01K2900 and 1BT01K2890, present a risk of serious injury as a result of the absence of a coherent conformity assessment and quality control regime. Consequently, there are essential safety features missing on some machines. </p>\n\n<p>Missing safety features include (but are not limited to):  </p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Longitudinal Load Moment Indicator (LLMI) and / or Longitudinal Load Moment Control, to alert the driver to potential overload or forward tipping,\n   </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Adequate seat construction, which has been assessed and labelled as meeting the required input spectral class, and </p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Suspension to the operator’s seat to reduce exposure to whole body vibration, </p>\n  </li>\n  <li>Appropriate guarding / protection to hydraulic hoses situated within the footwell of the cab to prevent the risk of thermal and / or high pressure injection injury to the operator. \n </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Load chart or information contained within the instructions for use for the safe use of additional attachments supplied with the machine such as the bucket.  </p>\n  </li>\n  <li>Appropriate identifying marks to the supplied attachments to indicate their suitability for use with this or any other machine.  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the harmonised Standard EN 1459-1 :2017 relied upon to demonstrate conformity. </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Supply of Machinery (Safety) Regulations 2008.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The sale or supply of machines with serial numbers 1BT01K2900 and 1BT01K2890 has been prohibited in Great Britain. </p>\n\n<p>Suppliers of this model in Great Britain should contact existing customers to make them aware of the risks associated with the use of machine if the essential safety features are absent.  </p>\n\n<p>Suppliers of this model in Great Britain should verify that any future imports include the appropriate safety features for the manufacturer’s stated intended use of the vehicle, and that the accompanying documents are representative of the machine supplied. </p>\n\n<p>End users of these machines should check that the safety features mentioned above are present on their machine. Any concerns regarding the safety or conformity of machines purchased should be referred back to their supplier.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0158</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Health and Safety Executive</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-18T10:18:18Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"machinery","product_measure_type":["temporary-ban-on-supply-offer-and-display-of-product","warning-consumers-of-risks"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-12-18","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-12-18T10:18:18+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-everun-ert-1500-rough-terrain-telehandler-2511-0158","api_url":"https